          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Thank you for your interest in the Stratus Drift, and your support in getting this company started.</p><p>Please fill out this application to be an approved vendor of Stratus products, and make your order.</p><p>Upon approval, you will receive an email and an invoice for your order. This must be paid by March 15th 2026. If not, you will not receive your order in this first batch. </p><p>Please allow 2 business days from the filling of this form for your approval and invoice.</p><p>All info and specs of our products can be found at <a href=\"https://stratusarchery.com/products/the-stratus-drift\">stratusarchery.com </a>Orders will start to be fulfilled in sequential order of purchase, in June 2026.</p><p>We will provide set up material, and other instructions for set up, guidance, service, etc. </p><p>For additional inquiries or questions please reach out to seth.anderson@stratusarchery.com</p><p></p><p>Price- Breakdown</p><p>MSRP $620</p><p>MAP 5% off ($589)</p><p>MOQ (Total ordered units not SKU specific) </p><p>2 units at 25% off MSRP</p><p>4  units at 30% off</p><p>20+ units 33%off</p>",
